#: /home/nefix/dev/fts_sql/specialAppInfoFakeDummyForL10nScript.php:4
msgid ""
"A full text search platform for the fulltextsearch framework that indexes "
"into the\n"
"database the Nextcloud instance already runs — PostgreSQL, MySQL/MariaDB or "
"SQLite — so nobody has to\n"
"operate Elasticsearch to get full text search.\n"
"\n"
"Plain text, the OOXML and ODF office formats "
"(.docx, .xlsx, .pptx, .odt, .ods, .odp), PDF and the legacy\n"
"binary Office formats (.doc, .xls, .ppt) are indexed by their body text, "
"extracted in pure PHP — no\n"
"external service, no external binary. Extraction runs over streams under a "
"memory budget, and a document\n"
"that cannot be read whole is still indexed on what was recovered, with the "
"reason counted on the admin\n"
"card."
msgstr ""

